# Relic's Roar sets the BASE power and toughness (CR 613.4b), so a pump on top still counts: Bot1's Ornithopter (an 0/2 artifact creature) gets Giant Growth
# (+3/+3, 3/5) and then Relic's Roar: base 4/3 plus 3/3 is 7/6 even though the pump came first (layer 7b before 7c). When Giant Growth wears off at the
# end of the turn so does the Roar.

